  'model':'heygen/avatar-iv',
  'prompt':'Create a vertical 9:16 talking-head video using the supplied reference photo and supplied Brazilian Portuguese audio. Preserve the speaker identity. Chest-up framing, dark studio look, navy blazer, direct serious expression, stable camera, natural restrained head and hand movement. No cuts, no scene changes, no on-screen text.',
